Id: prom001w
Severity: WARN
Category: network
Check: check_promisc
Fix: Take the interface out of promiscuous mode ('ip link set NAME promisc off').
References: ip-link(8)

An interface is in promiscuous mode: it hands all its traffic to
whoever listens, credentials and sessions among it. Bridges, VM hosts
and packet captures need it; anything else with the flag set means a
sniffer may be running, or one was and never cleaned up.
